    "updated_at": "2024-12-07T07:15:02Z",
    "body": "Oh I see, `<body>` is one of the few things that can sniff as HTML as per https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#determining-the-computed-mime-type-of-a-resource and there's no reason for no-sniff to be set. I'm less sure what ought to be done here then.",
